   <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="conbody:1;25:13">
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:1;26:10">The Vibration Z (vibz) is the vibration acceleration measured in the axial direction of the motor. This recorded data shows the vibration Z waveform data, in the unit of metre per second squared (m/s2). With the vibrations X and Z measured from the motor, the analytics system can detect the mechanical failures of the motor.</p>
      <ul class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="ul:1;27:11">
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="li:1;28:14">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:2;29:16">Each record contains an array of 15,000 samples captured on the specified timestamp.</p>
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:3;30:16">It is necessary to generate the corresponding X-axis data to plot this Vibration Z (vibx) waveform data in a graphic: The X-axis data is a vector of 15,000 data points with a step of 0.00016s.</p>
         </li>
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="li:2;32:14">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:4;33:16">For example:</p>
         </li>
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="li:3;35:14">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:5;36:16">[0, 0.00016, 0.00032, 0.00048, .... 2.39984]</p>
         </li>
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="li:4;38:14">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibz.dita" xtrc="p:6;39:16">For more information on API refer to the ADI OtoSense™ SMS REST API.</p>
         </li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
